CT%3E-for-T)\n* [Into\\<U\\>](#impl-Into%3CU%3E-for-T)\n* [ToOwned](#impl-ToOwned-for-T)\n* [TryFrom\\<U\\>](#impl-TryFrom%3CU%3E-for-T)\n* [TryInto\\<U\\>](#impl-TryInto%3CU%3E-for-T)\n\n[In nftables::schema](index.html)\n----------\n\n[nftables](../index.html)::[schema](index.html)\n\nStruct TableCopy item path\n==========\n\n[Source](../../src/nftables/schema.rs.html#158-169)\n\n```\npub struct Table<'a> {\n    pub family: NfFamily,\n    pub name: Cow<'a, str>,\n    pub handle: Option<u32>,\n}\n```\n\n<details class=\"toggle top-doc\" open=\"\"><summary class=\"hideme\">Expand description</summary>\n\nThis object describes a table.\n\n</details>\n\nFields[§](#fields)\n----------\n\n[§](#structfield.family)`family: [NfFamily](../types/enum.NfFamily.html)`\n\nThe table’s [family](../types/enum.NfFamily.html), e.g. “ip” or “ip6”.\n\n[§](#structfield.name)`name: [Cow](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/borrow/enum.Cow.html)<'a, [str](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/primitive.str.html)>`\n\nThe table’s name.\n\n[§](#structfield.handle)`handle: [Option](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/option/enum.Option.html)<[u32](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/primitive.u32.html)>`\n\nThe table’s handle.\n\nIn input, it is used only in [delete command](enum.NfCmd.html#variant.Delete) as\nalternative to **name**.\n\nTrait Implementations[§](#trait-implementations)\n----------\n\n<details class=\"toggle implementors-toggle\" open=\"\"><summary>\n\n[Source](../../src/nftables/schema.rs.html#156)[§](#impl-Clone-for-Table%3C'a%3E)\n\n### impl\\<'a\\> [Clone](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html) for [Table](struct.Table.html)\\<'a\\> ###\n\n</summary>\n\n<details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open=\"\"><summary>\n\n[Source](../../src/nftables/schema.rs.html#156)[§](#method.clone)\n\n#### fn [clone](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html#tymethod.clone)(&self) -\\> [Table](struct.Table.html)\\<'a\\> ####\n\n</summary>\n\nReturns a duplicate of the value. [Read more](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html#tymethod.clone)\n\n</details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open=\"\"><summary>\n\n1.0.0 · [Source](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/src/core/clone.rs.html#246-248)[§](#method.clone_from)\n\n#### fn [clone\\_from](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html#method.clone_from)(&mut self, source: &Self) ####\n\n</summary>\n\nPerforms copy-assignment from `source`. [Read more](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html#method.clone_from)\n\n</details>\n\n</details><details class=\"toggle implementors-toggle\" open=\"\"><summary>\n\n[Source](../../src/nftables/schema.rs.html#156)[§](#impl-Debug-for-Table%3C'a%3E)\n\n### impl\\<'a\\> [Debug](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/fmt/trait.Debug.html) for [Table](struct.Table.html)\\<'a\\> ###\n\n</summary>\n\n<details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open=\"\"><summary>\n\n[Source](../../src/nftables/schema.rs.html#156)[§](#method.fmt)\n\n#### fn [fmt](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/fmt/trait.Debug.html#tymethod.fmt)(&self, f: &mut [Formatter](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/fmt/struct.Formatter.html)\\<'\\_\\>) -\\> [Result](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/fmt/type.Result.html) ####\n\n</summary>\n\nFormats the value using the given formatter. [Read more](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/fmt/trait.Debug.html#tymethod.fmt)\n\n</details>\n\n</details><details class=\"toggle implementors-toggle\" open=\"\"><summary>\n\n[Source](../../src/nftables/schema.rs.html#172-180)[§](#impl-Default-for-Table%3C'_%3E)\n\n### impl [Default](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/default/trait.Default.html) for [Table](struct.Table.html)\\<'\\_\\> ###\n\nDefault table.\n\n</summary>\n\n<details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open=\"\"><summary>\n\n[Source](../../src/nftables/schema.rs.html#173-179)[§](#method.default)\n\n#### fn [default](https://doc.rus