cy policy](https://foundation.rust-lang.org/policies/privacy-policy/#docs.rs)\n\n* [Rust](#)\n  * [Rust website](https://www.rust-lang.org/)\n  * [The Book](https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/)\n  * [Standard Library API Reference](https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/)\n  * [Rust by Example](https://doc.rust-lang.org/rust-by-example/)\n  * [The Cargo Guide](https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/)\n  * [Clippy Documentation](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/clippy)\n\n<iframe src=\"/-/storage-change-detection.html\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\" style=\"display: none\"></iframe>\n\n[nftables](../../nftables/index.html)0.6.3\n----------\n\n[Chain](#)\n----------\n\n### [Fields](#fields) ###\n\n* [\\_type](#structfield._type)\n* [dev](#structfield.dev)\n* [family](#structfield.family)\n* [handle](#structfield.handle)\n* [hook](#structfield.hook)\n* [name](#structfield.name)\n* [newname](#structfield.newname)\n* [policy](#structfield.policy)\n* [prio](#structfield.prio)\n* [table](#structfield.table)\n\n### [Trait Implementations](#trait-implementations) ###\n\n* [Clone](#impl-Clone-for-Chain%3C'a%3E)\n* [Debug](#impl-Debug-for-Chain%3C'a%3E)\n* [Default](#impl-Default-for-Chain%3C'_%3E)\n* [Deserialize\\<'de\\>](#impl-Deserialize%3C'de%3E-for-Chain%3C'a%3E)\n* [Eq](#impl-Eq-for-Chain%3C'a%3E)\n* [JsonSchema](#impl-JsonSchema-for-Chain%3C'a%3E)\n* [PartialEq](#impl-PartialEq-for-Chain%3C'a%3E)\n* [Serialize](#impl-Serialize-for-Chain%3C'a%3E)\n* [StructuralPartialEq](#impl-StructuralPartialEq-for-Chain%3C'a%3E)\n\n### [Auto Trait Implementations](#synthetic-implementations) ###\n\n* [Freeze](#impl-Freeze-for-Chain%3C'a%3E)\n* [RefUnwindSafe](#impl-RefUnwindSafe-for-Chain%3C'a%3E)\n* [Send](#impl-Send-for-Chain%3C'a%3E)\n* [Sync](#impl-Sync-for-Chain%3C'a%3E)\n* [Unpin](#impl-Unpin-for-Chain%3C'a%3E)\n* [UnwindSafe](#impl-UnwindSafe-for-Chain%3C'a%3E)\n\n### [Blanket Implementations](#blanket-implementations) ###\n\n* [Any](#impl-Any-for-T)\n* [Borrow\\<T\\>](#impl-Borrow%3CT%3E-for-T)\n* [BorrowMut\\<T\\>](#impl-BorrowMut%3CT%3E-for-T)\n* [CloneToUninit](#impl-CloneToUninit-for-T)\n* [DeserializeOwned](#impl-DeserializeOwned-for-T)\n* [DynClone](#impl-DynClone-for-T)\n* [From\\<T\\>](#impl-From%3CT%3E-for-T)\n* [Into\\<U\\>](#impl-Into%3CU%3E-for-T)\n* [ToOwned](#impl-ToOwned-for-T)\n* [TryFrom\\<U\\>](#impl-TryFrom%3CU%3E-for-T)\n* [TryInto\\<U\\>](#impl-TryInto%3CU%3E-for-T)\n\n[In nftables::schema](index.html)\n----------\n\n[nftables](../index.html)::[schema](index.html)\n\nStruct ChainCopy item path\n==========\n\n[Source](../../src/nftables/schema.rs.html#184-228)\n\n```\npub struct Chain<'a> {\n    pub family: NfFamily,\n    pub table: Cow<'a, str>,\n    pub name: Cow<'a, str>,\n    pub newname: Option<Cow<'a, str>>,\n    pub handle: Option<u32>,\n    pub _type: Option<NfChainType>,\n    pub hook: Option<NfHook>,\n    pub prio: Option<i32>,\n    pub dev: Option<Cow<'a, str>>,\n    pub policy: Option<NfChainPolicy>,\n}\n```\n\n<details class=\"toggle top-doc\" open=\"\"><summary class=\"hideme\">Expand description</summary>\n\nThis object describes a chain.\n\n</details>\n\nFields[§](#fields)\n----------\n\n[§](#structfield.family)`family: [NfFamily](../types/enum.NfFamily.html)`\n\nThe table’s family.\n\n[§](#structfield.table)`table: [Cow](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/borrow/enum.Cow.html)<'a, [str](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/primitive.str.html)>`\n\nThe table’s name.\n\n[§](#structfield.name)`name: [Cow](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/borrow/enum.Cow.html)<'a, [str](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/primitive.str.html)>`\n\nThe chain’s name.\n\n[§](#structfield.newname)`newname: [Option](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/option/enum.Option.html)<[Cow](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/borrow/enum.Cow.html)<'a, [str](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/primitive.str.html)>>`\n\nNew name of the chain when supplied to the [rename command](enum.NfCmd.html#variant.Rename).\n\n[§](#structfield.handle)`handle: [Option](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/option/enum.Option.html)<[u32](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/primitive.u32.html)>`\n\nThe chain’s handle.\nIn input, it is used only in [delete command](enum.NfCmd.html#variant.Delete) as alternative to **name**.\n\n[§](#structfield._type)`_type: [Option](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/option/enum.Option.html)<[NfChainType](../types/enum.NfChainType.html)>`\n\nThe chain’s type.\nRequired for [base chains](Base chains).\n\n(Base chains): [https://wiki.nftables.org/wiki-nftables/index.php/Configuring\\_chains#Adding\\_base\\_chains](https://wiki.nftables.org/wiki-nftables/index.php/Configuring_chains#Adding_base_chains)\n\n[§](#structfield.hook)`hook: [Option](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/option/enum.Option.html)<[NfHook](../types/enum.NfHook.html)>`\n\nThe chain’s hook.\nRequired for [base chains](Base chains).\n\n(Base chains): [https://wiki.nftables.org/wiki-nftables/index.php/Configuring\\_chains#Adding\\_base\\_chains](https://wiki.nftables.org/wiki-nftables/index.php/Configuring_chains#Adding_base_chains)\n\n[§](#structfield.prio)`prio: [Option](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/option/enum.Option.html)<[i32](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/primitive.i32.html)>`\n\nThe chain’s priority.\nRequired for [base chains](Base chains).\n\n(Base chains): [https://wiki.nftables.org/wiki-nftables/index.php/Configuring\\_chains#Adding\\_base\\_chains](https://wiki.nftables.org/wiki-nftables/index.php/Configuring_chains#Adding_base_chains)\n\n[§](#structfield.dev)`dev: [Option](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/option/enum.Option.html)<[Cow](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/borrow/enum.Cow.html)<'a, [str](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/primitive.str.html)>>`\n\nThe chain’s bound interface (if in the netdev family).\nRequired for [base chains](Base chains).\n\n(Base chains): [https://wiki.nftables.org/wiki-nftables/index.php/Configuring\\_chains#Adding\\_base\\_chains](https://wiki.nftables.org/wiki-nftables/index.php/Configuring_chains#Adding_base_chains)\n\n[§](#structfield.policy)`policy: [Option](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/option/enum.Option.html)<[NfChainPolicy](../types/enum.NfChainPolicy.html)>`\n\nThe chain’s [policy](../types/enum.NfChainPolicy.html).\nRequired for [base chains](Base chains).\n\n(Base chains): [https://wiki.nftables.org/wiki-nftables/index.php/Configuring\\_chains#Adding\\_base\\_chains](https://wiki.nftables.org/wiki-nftables/index.php/Configuring_chains#Adding_base_chains)\n\nTrait Implementations[§](#trait-implementations)\n----------\n\n<details class=\"toggle implementors-toggle\" open=\"\"><summary>\n\n[Source](../../src/nftables/schema.rs.html#182)[§](#impl-Clone-for-Chain%3C'a%3E)\n\n### impl\\<'a\\> [Clone](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html) for [Chain](struct.Chain.html)\\<'a\\> ###\n\n</summary>\n\n<details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open=\"\"><summary>\n\n[Source](../../src/nftables/schema.rs.html#182)[§](#method.clone)\n\n#### fn [clone](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html#tymethod.clone)(&self) -\\> [Chain](struct.Chain.html)\\<'a\\> ####\n\n</summary>\n\nReturns a duplicate of the value. [Read more](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html#tymethod.clone)\n\n</details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open=\"\"><summary>\n\n1.0.0 · [Source](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/src/core/clone.rs.html#246-248)[§](#method.clone_from)\n\n#### fn [clone\\_from](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html#method.clone_from)(&mut self, source: &Self) ####\n\n</summary>\n\nPerforms copy-assignment from `source`. [Read more](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html#method.clone_from)\n\n</details>\n\n</details><details class=\"toggle implementors-toggle\" open=\"\"><summary>\n\n[Source](../../src/nftables/schema.rs.html#182)[§](#impl-Debug-for-Chain%3C'a%3E