ttps://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/option/enum.Option.html)<[HashSet](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/collections/hash/set/struct.HashSet.html)<[LogFlag](enum.LogFlag.html)>>`\n\nLog flags.\n\nImplementations[§](#implementations)\n----------\n\n<details class=\"toggle implementors-toggle\" open=\"\"><summary>\n\n[Source](../../src/nftables/stmt.rs.html#365-376)[§](#impl-Log%3C'_%3E)\n\n### impl [Log](struct.Log.html)\\<'\\_\\> ###\n\n</summary>\n\n[Source](../../src/nftables/stmt.rs.html#366-375)\n\n#### pub fn [new](#method.new)(group: [Option](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/option/enum.Option.html)\\<[u32](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/primitive.u32.html)\\>) -\\> Self ####\n\n</details>\n\nTrait Implementations[§](#trait-implementations)\n----------\n\n<details class=\"toggle implementors-toggle\" open=\"\"><summary>\n\n[Source](../../src/nftables/stmt.rs.html#332)[§](#impl-Clone-for-Log%3C'a%3E)\n\n### impl\\<'a\\> [Clone](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html) for [Log](struct.Log.html)\\<'a\\> ###\n\n</summary>\n\n<details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open=\"\"><summary>\n\n[Source](../../src/nftables/stmt.rs.html#332)[§](#method.clone)\n\n#### fn [clone](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html#tymethod.clone)(&self) -\\> [Log](struct.Log.html)\\<'a\\> ####\n\n</summary>\n\nReturns a duplicate of the value. [Read more](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html#tymethod.clone)\n\n</details><details class=\"toggle method-toggle\" open=\"\"><summary>\n\n1.0.0 · [Source](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/src/core/clone.rs.html#246-248)[§](#method.clone_from)\n\n#### fn [clone\\_from](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html#method.clone_from)(&mut self, source: &Self) ####\n\n</summary>\n\nPerforms copy-assignment from `source`. [Read more](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/clone/trait.Clone.html#method.clone_from)\n\n</details>\n\n</details><deta